        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "6f33197f318c",
            "text": "The acquired property provided exposure to a growing market, the potential for long-term appreciation, and access to recurring rental income. At the same time, it reduced reliance on traditional financial assets by introducing a tangible component to the overall investment portfolio.",
