        "style": "normal",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "1e52317d478f",
            "text": "A selection of modern apartments was identified in locations with proven rental demand and strong long-term growth prospects. Each option was evaluated based on location, construction quality, expected rental performance, and future resale potential.",
